 "words_heard": 203,
 "words": 207,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He grew up like a tender shoot",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A root in thirsty ground",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No beauty there to hold our eyes",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No glory to be found",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was despised and rejected by men",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A man of sorrows, acquainted with grief",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he was pierced for our transgressions",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Crushed for our iniquities",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The punishment that brought us peace was laid upon him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And by his wounds we are healed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We hid our faces when he passed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We thought that God had struck him down",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We never knew the weight he bore",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Was ours and not his own",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet it was our griefs he bore",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our sorrows he carried",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he was pierced for our transgressions",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Crushed for our iniquities",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The punishment that brought us peace was laid upon him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And by his wounds we are healed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All of us have strayed like sheep",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one has turned to his own way",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the LORD has laid on him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The iniquity of us all",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a lamb led to the slaughter",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not open his mouth",
